# Google Trends 配置模板

## 基础配置

```json
{
  "name": "google-trends",
  "description": "Google Trends 数据获取配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "api": "pytrends",
  "config": {
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "timezone": 360,
    "geo": "",
    "timeframe": "today 3-m"
  },
  "features": [
    "关键词趋势",
    "地区分布",
    "相关查询",
    "实时趋势"
  ],
  "setup": {
    "install": "pip install pytrends pandas matplotlib plotly",
    "usage": "使用 pytrends 库获取数据"
  },
  "parameters": {
    "geo": {
      "global": "",
      "china": "CN",
      "usa": "US",
      "japan": "JP"
    },
    "timeframe": {
      "now_1h": "now 1-H",
      "today": "today 1-d",
      "past_7d": "today 7-d",
      "past_30d": "today 30-d",
      "past_3m": "today 3-m",
      "past_12m": "today 12-m",
      "past_5y": "today 5-y"
    }
  }
}
```

## 使用示例

```python
from pytrends.request import TrendReq

pytrends = TrendReq(hl='zh-CN', tz=360)

# 构建负载
pytrends.build_payload(
    kw_list=['ChatGPT', 'OpenAI', 'AI助手'],
    timeframe='today 3-m',
    geo='CN'
)

# 获取趋势数据
interest_over_time = pytrends.interest_over_time()
interest_by_region = pytrends.interest_by_region()
related_queries = pytrends.related_queries()
```

## 文件位置
`templates/google-ai/google-trends-config.json`
